  "description": "This receipt is a thermal point-of-sale (POS) receipt issued by Warung Nasi Alam Sunda, located at Jl. Raya Cipanas No. 173, Sindanglaya, Kecamatan Cipanas, Kabupaten Cianjur, West Java 43253, Indonesia. The header displays the restaurant branding, full business address, WhatsApp contact number, POS location (CIPANAS), and cashier identifier (RENA). The receipt includes an invoice number, transaction date and time, table number, guest count (PAX), and cashier name before the itemized transaction section. The footer contains transaction totals, including Total Item, Total Quantity, Subtotal, Total, Cash, and Change, followed by the closing timestamp, a customer appreciation message, and a notice that the restaurant accepts Nasi Box orders. This is a standard restaurant POS receipt used for dine-in transactions in Indonesia.",
